01:24.100 --> 01:29.980
<b>Mr. Villain's Day Off</b>

01:30.550 --> 01:35.990
<i>Lately I've been seeing a stray cat 
around my usual convenience store.</i>

01:43.490 --> 01:48.500
<b>You'll find convenient ready-made food at the checkout counter!</b>

01:48.500 --> 01:50.750
<b>impatient</b>

