02:07.360 --> 02:08.260
Hello.

02:30.030 --> 02:33.150
<i>The kitty is as adorable as ever today.</i>

02:33.780 --> 02:37.540
<i>I can't take my eyes off that tail,
 with its mind of its own.</i>

02:37.930 --> 02:40.580
<i>You look so smooth and soft.</i>

02:41.040 --> 02:45.050
<i>If I had my way, I would so pet you.</i>

02:54.000 --> 02:56.900
What, are you still hungry?

02:57.350 --> 03:00.190
Sorry, but that's all I have on me today.

03:01.430 --> 03:02.800
I'll bring more next time.

03:04.620 --> 03:09.690
<i>Th-This guy makes it look so easy!</i>

03:09.690 --> 03:14.160
<i>And here I've never gotten
 to pet it even once!</i>

03:14.710 --> 03:17.960
<i>What entices it so?!</i>

03:18.490 --> 03:20.130
All righty.

03:20.130 --> 03:22.280
It's time for me to get going.

03:27.080 --> 03:27.900
Wait...

03:33.900 --> 03:36.230
Take this, if you'd like.

03:36.590 --> 03:38.770
<i>What is that?</i>

03:39.400 --> 03:41.300
The cat loves this stuff.

03:43.570 --> 03:46.590
<i>Winning it over with its favorite foods?</i>

03:46.590 --> 03:48.590
<i>That's sneaky, Earthling!</i>

03:50.600 --> 03:54.280
But you said you didn't 
have anything else today.

03:54.280 --> 03:55.550
Oh, yeah.

03:55.550 --> 03:59.800
I completely forgot I had that in my pocket.

04:11.650 --> 04:16.450
<i>Let's see if what you say is true, Earthling!</i>

04:19.910 --> 04:22.940
How about some dessert, kitty?

04:27.880 --> 04:29.850
Welcome home, Black.

04:31.760 --> 04:33.820
Good morning, Black.

04:34.710 --> 04:35.910
Mugi.

04:35.910 --> 04:37.160
Sora.

04:37.600 --> 04:39.820
Thanks, and good morning.

04:40.340 --> 04:42.040
What are you two doing up?

04:42.040 --> 04:46.610
We have to get up this early these days,
 or else we'll never see you.

04:46.610 --> 04:49.930
You're always asleep when we're awake.

04:50.360 --> 04:52.180
Sorry about that.

04:52.410 --> 04:56.580
Since we haven't seen you in so long, 
we wouldn't mind if you carried us.

05:02.390 --> 05:04.770
You two have gotten heavy.

05:05.780 --> 05:07.300
Ouch.

05:07.300 --> 05:09.240
Where'd that kick come from?

05:09.240 --> 05:10.360
Straight from Pink.

05:10.760 --> 05:11.950
Sounds about right.

05:18.250 --> 05:18.630
Schedule

05:28.880 --> 05:33.720
<i>I couldn't resist that cat. 
It reminded me of these two.</i>

05:41.350 --> 05:45.790
<i>But he does seem to frequent that store, 
just like the reports say.</i>

05:46.450 --> 05:48.210
<i>He was an odd one.</i>

05:48.690 --> 05:50.360
<i>I guess he likes cats?</i>

05:56.940 --> 06:00.260
<i>How can this be?</i>

06:01.090 --> 06:05.710
<i>Kitty's going to town on this thing
 like nothing I've ever seen!</i>

06:07.270 --> 06:10.470
<i>I'm so grateful, Earthling!</i>

